}
```
Then shadows static only; NPCs/trash shadows baked from initial? The static bake source meshes cast shadows; dynamic NPCs appear after? At first frame all dynamic present, shadow map includes them but never updates. NPCs move, leaving stale shadows. Could look odd. Better update shadows every 6 frames:
```
if (softwareRenderer) {
